WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:11.080
Father is on the verge of winning the hearts of all people across the realm. Chancellor Yu Gong has always been upright and incorruptible; he merely misspoke in his cups and has now been maliciously framed. If Father extends imperial mercy to him, you will surely win the devotion of the realm!

00:11.680 --> 00:17.000
So according to you: if I do not pardon this man, then I, your Emperor, lack the hearts of my own people?!

00:17.640 --> 00:22.000
Your son misspoke! Father Emperor already possesses the boundless love of all under heaven!

00:24.840 --> 00:38.360
In my eyes, you have grown far too cozy with those who fancy themselves pure and noble! The books of the sages are fine and good—read them, and suddenly everyone wants to pose as an unyielding, righteous remonstrator, believing a single flap of their jaw can govern the realm!

00:40.440 --> 00:45.500
A solitary pedantic scholar keeps you up past midnight, and keeps your Emperor from sleeping as well!

00:47.200 --> 00:55.160
My second son: tell me... if you sat upon my throne today, and Yu Gong directed those curses at you, what would you do?
